  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 — .NET 8 LTS support: the package now multi-targets net8.0 and net10.0, tracking PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.3.0 in lockstep. New: AddPqSigning() registers PqSigner/PqVerifier from the new PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Signing package (detached Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 signatures). No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
